    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hrm...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480072006D002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank goodness! It finally stopped.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B00200067006F006F0064006E0065007300730021002000490074002000660069006E0061006C006C0079002000730074006F0070007000650064002E001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What were you thinking, letting your Whirlipede\nrun wild through the city like that?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh no... She looks upset.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006E006F002E002E002E00200053006800650020006C006F006F006B0073002000750070007300650074002E001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m with the Fist of Justice, a group dedicated to\ngetting rid of wild zones so that Pokémon and<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npeople can truly coexist in Lumiose.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Letting your Whirlipede run amok like that... It’s\ngoing to make people think Pokémon are scary!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAre you trying to make the Fist of Justice look bad\nor something?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 171
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, not at all!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006E006F007400200061007400200061006C006C0021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whirlipede just suddenly started rolling and\nzoomed off!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800690072006C006900700065006400650020006A007500730074002000730075006400640065006E006C00790020007300740061007200740065006400200072006F006C006C0069006E006700200061006E0064000A007A006F006F006D006500640020006F006600660021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I didn’t mean to make anyone look bad! I swear!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006400690064006E201900740020006D00650061006E00200074006F0020006D0061006B006500200061006E0079006F006E00650020006C006F006F006B00200062006100640021002000490020007300770065006100720021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whether you meant to or not, it makes trouble for\nus when Pokémon act dangerously out in public!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think the Fist of Justice needs to help teach you\na lesson!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007400680069006E006B0020007400680065002000460069007300740020006F00660020004A0075007300740069006300650020006E006500650064007300200074006F002000680065006C007000200074006500610063006800200079006F0075000A00610020006C006500730073006F006E002100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Teach me a lesson? Uh, OK, but I’d rather not do\nanything painful...or scary...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "First off, you need to learn everything you can\nabout your Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004600690072007300740020006F00660066002C00200079006F00750020006E00650065006400200074006F0020006C006500610072006E002000650076006500720079007400680069006E006700200079006F0075002000630061006E000A00610062006F0075007400200079006F0075007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whirlipede are surprisingly aggressive—they\ndon’t hesitate to smash into things at high speed.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon will obey you as long as you have a high\nenough Royale Rank. But if that’s not the case...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "you should train with the Fist of Justice so that\nyou’re able to stop Whirlipede on your own!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHave I made myself clear?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y-yes, understood!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002D007900650073002C00200075006E00640065007200730074006F006F00640021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait, does this mean I’ll be training under Ivor?\nTHAT Ivor?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100690074002C00200064006F00650073002000740068006900730020006D00650061006E002000492019006C006C00200062006500200074007200610069006E0069006E006700200075006E006400650072002000490076006F0072003F000A0054004800410054002000490076006F0072003F001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That sounds just as painful and scary as being\nmowed down by my Whirlipede!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guess I need to step up my game as a Trainer if I\nwant to work better with my partner Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
